	(text "U6 (hardware/gal/ecb_bridge_claim.pld): U7 turns toward the Model I (DIR low) only for reads an ECB card\nanswers: memory 3000-37DF and 8000-FFFF, ports 40-43, 50-53, 70-73, C0-CF. Otherwise it passes Model I\ndata to ECB, and it is disabled during reads nobody answers. Add new cards' read ranges to U6."
